# Put wordlists here (e.g. rockyou.txt). Real wordlists are gitignored so you
# don't commit large/again-sensitive files. Get the classic teaching list with:
#   sudo apt-get install wordlists
#   sudo gunzip -k /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt.gz
# then point crack_handshake.sh at it with --wordlist.
